  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. All adjacent foes suffer from Disease for 1...8...10 second[s]. For 20 seconds, nothing happens. Disease duration is doubled if you are enchanted when you activate this skill. When this enchantment ends, all party members in earshot are cured of Disease.",
      "zhTW": "使鄰近敵人遭受疾病 1～10 秒，若施展時你有加持效果，則疾病時間加倍。接下來的 20 秒，此加持並沒有直接效果。此加持結束時，將治好音量所及範圍內的所有隊友身上的疾病。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. All adjacent foes suffer from Disease for 2...5...6 second[s]. For 20 seconds, nothing happens. Disease duration is doubled if you are enchanted when you activate this skill. When this enchantment ends, all party members in earshot are cured of Disease.",
      "zhTW": "使鄰近敵人遭受疾病 2～6 秒，若施展時你有加持效果，則疾病時間加倍。接下來的 20 秒，此加持並沒有直接效果。此加持結束時，將治好音量所及範圍內的所有隊友身上的疾病。"
    }
  },
